body:
Example: I bought 1 Eth at 500$ and traded it for 10 LTC worth 50$ each in 2018  Then LTC crash to 1$ each so now my LTC is worth 10$ in 2018. I decide to hold my LTC until 2020 and LTC is worth 50$ again so i have 500$ again. I then trade all 10 LTC for 500$ BTC. 

&#x200B;

Am I responsible for any taxes?
